26,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I have information. Mizuki, you are the werewolf. We should execute her today.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"That's a very bold claim for the first day. @Toshio, are you the Seer?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, that's quite a leap. I'm a human. You're likely the werewolf trying to frame me early.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,1,1,talk,Minato,,Oh no... is there already a fight? I believe we should listen to both sides.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,A sudden accusation. It creates a tense atmosphere. I wonder who is telling the truth.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I am the Seer. I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was clear. She is the werewolf.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Toshio is the Seer, the logic is simple. But if he's the werewolf, he's trying to lead us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,@Toshio is lying. A real Seer wouldn't be so aggressive immediately; they'd be more cautious to avoid being attacked.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, you seem very confident. But @Toshio also seems very sure. I'm confused.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, your defense is logical, but @Toshio's claim is direct. It's a difficult choice.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I have no reason to lie. If you execute me instead, the werewolf remains.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, @Jonathan, what do you think? I'm leaning towards Toshio's claim because it's so specific.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Jonathan"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Don't be fooled by his confidence. He's trying to manipulate your kindness.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,3,talk,Minato,,I... I think I trust @Toshio. He seems very serious.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I also feel that Toshio's conviction is genuine. I will trust the Seer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's vote.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm ready.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,This is a mistake you'll regret tomorrow.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I'm sorry, Mizuki-san.","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,May the truth prevail.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
